MOSS Prompt Enhancer Local

Includes unmodified MOSS-Image prompt skill, Layout reference and prompt compiler
from OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image (Apache License 2.0).
Upstream: https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/tree/main/skills/moss-image-prompt-enhancer

The local adapter replaces tool/file-writing instructions with JSON output,
executes the official compiler in-process, and uses an existing local llama-server.
The llama.cpp executable and model weights are not redistributed in this package.

Integrated editor derived from kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes (GNU GPL version 3).
Upstream: https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes
Ported sources: web/js/ideogram4_prompt_builder.js,
web/js/moss_image_prompt_builder.js, and web/js/utility.js.
The editor's original interface and interactions are retained. Adaptations connect
it to this node, isolate extension/template namespaces, retain missing metadata,
normalize imported drafts, preserve canvas dimensions, and restore named widgets.
The combined distribution is provided under GPL-3.0-only. Original Apache-2.0
components retain their notices and license; both license texts are in LICENSE.
Content-type prompt rules are independently implemented, informed by the MOSS
skill and the user's illustration brief. No MangaLayout code is copied.
